Account Manager at Oxford University Press, has put together the proceedings from the Conference. It’s the twelfth year for Leah Hinds, Executive Director, and the fourth year that we are joined by Lars Meyer, Director, Access & Resource Services, Library & Information Technology Services at Emory University. We are pleased to share some of the learning experiences that we, and other attendees, had at the conference.","authors":["Meyer, Lars"],"language":"en","year":2021,"publisher":"Annual Reviews","isbn":[],"doi":"10.3998/mpub.12470905","subjects":["Charleston conference","Charleston conference proceedings","Ebooks","Affordable course materials","Print reading","Reading formats","Print vs. digital","Publishing business models","Research librarians","Society publishers","Library services","Library stakeholders","Scholarly publishing management","Library collections","Online learning","Open access","thema EDItEUR::C Language and Linguistics::CB Language: reference and general","thema EDItEUR::G Reference, Information and Interdisciplinary subjects::GL Library and information sciences / Museology::GLC Library, archive and information management","thema EDItEUR::G Reference, Information and Interdisciplinary subjects::GL Library and information sciences / Museology::GLM Library and information services"],"source":"OAPEN Library","source_url":"https://library.oapen.org/handle/20.500.12657/116961","cover_url":"https://library.oapen.org/rest/bitstreams/0cbd9c8e-311b-4f78-bc68-fac19ba4bf0f/retrieve","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/rest/bitstreams/e2174c8f-3732-46b7-ae4d-7d55ea4e15fb/retrieve"},{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/20.500.12657/116961/1/9781941269527.pdf"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/ · CC-BY-NC-ND · Other open license","verified_legal":true,"resource_type":"book","identifiers":{"source_id":"20.500.12657/116961","handle":"20.500.12657/116961","dspace_