aken into account in the production of art? What role do customs regulations, political border restrictions, and sustainability play? This publication focuses on contexts, networks, material flows and the conditions of production and distribution within the arts of the 20th and 21st century. Contribution to the growing field of infrastructural studies in art history from a transnational perspective Art history of production, transport and logistics Mapping the technical, political, and economic conditions of the cultural field","authors":[],"language":"en","year":2026,"publisher":"De Gruyter","isbn":[],"doi":"","subjects":["Art","21st century","Contemporary art","Modern art","Art production","Transnational perspective","Institution","Logistics","Art world","Kunst","21. Jahrhundert","Zeitgenössische Kunst","Moderne","Kunstproduktion","Transnationale Perspektive","Logistik","Kunstbetrieb","thema EDItEUR::A The Arts::AG The Arts: treatments and subjects::AGA History of art","thema EDItEUR::A The Arts::AB The arts: general topics"],"source":"OAPEN Library","source_url":"https://library.oapen.org/handle/20.500.12657/116904","cover_url":"https://library.oapen.org/rest/bitstreams/97c92b01-f88c-4a12-8678-e1864c5e2e5b/retrieve","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/rest/bitstreams/dde77094-6afa-4dfc-8889-d6cf5421a6c7/retrieve"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ · CC-BY · Other open license","verified_legal":true,"resource_type":"book","identifiers":{"source_id":"20.500.12657/116904","handle":"20.500.12657/116904","dspace_uuid":"05644557-eb8d-4451-9256-b21edb7f1523"},"providers":[{"source":"OAPEN Library","source_id":"20.500.12657/116904","source_url":"https://library.oapen.org/handle/20.500.12657/116904","language":"en","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/rest/bitstreams/dde77094-6afa-4dfc-8889-d6cf5421a6c7/retrieve"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"https://creativecommons.or