structor answer keys, and more), all OpenStax textbooks are fully customizable. Explore our texts below and adopt any and all parts us","{'id': 203, 'meta': {'type': 'books.BookCategories'}, 'subject_name': 'Nursing', 'subject_category': 'Medical-Surgical Nursing'}"],"source":"OpenStax","source_url":"https://openstax.org/details/books/medical-surgical-nursing","cover_url":"https://assets.openstax.org/oscms-prodcms/media/documents/medical-surgical_nursing_web_card.svg","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://assets.openstax.org/oscms-prodcms/media/documents/Medical-Surgical_Nursing-WEB.pdf"},{"type":"read","url":"https://openstax.org/books/medical-surgical-nursing/pages/1-introduction"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike License 4.0","verified_legal":true,"resource_type":"textbook","identifiers":{"source_id":"cede1974-4a2e-47e9-bf60-8ab91962bb1f","openstax_slug":"medical-surgical-nursing","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/"},"providers":[{"source":"OpenStax","source_id":"cede1974-4a2e-47e9-bf60-8ab91962bb1f","source_url":"https://openstax.org/details/books/medical-surgical-nursing","language":"en","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://assets.openstax.org/oscms-prodcms/media/documents/Medical-Surgical_Nursing-WEB.pdf"},{"type":"read","url":"https://openstax.org/books/medical-surgical-nursing/pages/1-introduction"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike License 4.0","verified_legal":true}]},{"id":"work:24d34e08ffb5688e2b104531","title":"Meditations","subtitle":"","description":"","authors":["Marcus Aurelius, Emperor of Rome"],"language":"en","year":null,"publisher":"Project Gutenberg","isbn":[],"doi":"","subjects":["Ethics","Life","Stoics","Category: Biographies","Category: Classics of Literature","Category: Philosophy & Ethics","Harvard Classics"],"source":"Project Gutenberg","source_url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/2680","cover_url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/cache/epub/2680/pg2680.cover.medium.jpg","formats":[{"type":"html","url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/2680.html.images"},{"type":"epub","url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/2680.epub3.images"},{"type":"mobi","url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/2680.kf8.images"},{"type":"text","url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/2680.txt.utf-8"}],"access":"public_domain","license":"Public domain in the United States","verified_legal":true,"resource_type":"book","identifiers":{"source_id":"2680","gutenberg_id":"2680"},"providers":[{"source":"Project Gutenberg","source_id":"2680","source_url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/2680","language":"en","formats":[{"type":"html","url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/2680.html.images"},{"type":"epub","url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/2680.epub3.images"},{"type":"mobi","url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/2680.kf8.images"},{"type":"text","url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/2680.txt.utf-8"}],"access":"public_domain","license":"Public domain in the United States","verified_legal":true}]},{"id":"work:336f0ad082cdbea55834687b","title":"Mehrsprachigkeit in der Familie","subtitle":"Studie zur migrationsbedingten Mehrsprachigkeit am Beispiel von Familien mit russischsprachigem Hintergrund in Deutschland","description":"Die Studie beschäftigt sich mit der Mehrsprachigkeit in der Familie aus der gesprächsanalytischen, soziolinguistischen und sprachbiographischen Perspektive. Sie wurde am Beispiel von Migrantenfamilien mit russischsprachigem Hintergrund durchgeführt und stellt drei Forschungsfragen: 1. Wie wirken sich Sprachbiographien einzelner Familienmitglieder auf die sprachliche Situation innerhalb einer Migrantenfamilie aus? 2. In welcher Beziehung stehen die Sprachen Deutsch und Russisch zueinander in den Gesprächen zwischen einzelnen Familienmitgliedern? 3. Wie können denkbare sprachliche Situationen variationslinguistisch typifiziert werden? Bei der Analyse wurde festgestellt, dass die sprachliche Entwicklung einer Migrantenfamilie über einige Etappen (Einreise der Eltern, Geburt der Kinder, Kindergartenbesuch, Einschulung und Grundschule, Jugend, Zeit nach der Schule) erfolgen kann. Weiterhin wurde eine Typologie der zweisprachigen Gespräche in einer Migrantenfamilie aufgestellt (Code-Switching, parallel zweisprachige Kommunikation, Code-Mixing, Code-Mixing – zwei plus eins sowie Wechsel der Matrixsprache). Schließlich wurde die Sprechweise in einer Migrantenfamilie als Familienstil erfasst.","authors":["Ritter, Anna Gloria"],"language":"de","year":2025,"publisher":"De Gruyter","isbn":[],"doi":"","subjects":["Mehrsprachigkeit in der Familie","Migration in Deutschland","Russisch","thema EDItEUR::C Language and Linguistics::CF Linguistics"],"source":"OAPEN Library","source_url":"https://library.oapen.org/handle/20.500.12657/116935","cover_url":"https://directory.doabooks.org/rest/bitstreams/3a3218e6-b125-4547-bf35-a8a72240a9b4/retrieve","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/rest/bitstreams/936ffcc6-b167-48df-87b6-00bcc0da57ca/retrieve"},{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/20.500.12657/116935/1/9783111632223.pdf"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/ · CC-BY-ND · Other open license","verified_legal":true,"resource_type":"book","identifiers":{"source_id":"20.500.12657/116935","handle":"20.500.12854/181536","dspace_uuid":"b5cdfde7-0aa2-4802-b0c0-da68e2af559c","oapen_library_source_id":"20.500.12657/116935","oapen_library_handle":"20.500.12657/116935","oapen_library_dspace_uuid":"a9e0ecd3-4add-4992-a47a-fa3f3f552e68","doab_source_id":"20.500.12854/181536"},"providers":[{"source":"OAPEN Library","source_id":"20.500.12657/116935","source_url":"https://library.oapen.org/handle/20.500.12657/116935","language":"de","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/rest/bitstreams/936ffcc6-b167-48df-87b6-00bcc0da57ca/retrieve"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/ · CC-BY-ND · Other open license","verified_legal":true},{"source":"DOAB","source_id":"20.500.12854/181536","source_url":"https://directory.doabooks.org/handle/20.500.12854/181536","language":"de","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/20.500.12657/116935/1/9783111632223.pdf"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"open access · https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/ · CC-BY-ND","verified_legal":true}]},{"id":"work:a51ef3acc0ee79ba1530e6ab","title":"Mental Health in Literatur, Populärmedien und Medizin","subtitle":"Aushandlungen von psychischer Gesundheit und Krankheit aus intersektionaler Perspektive","description":"Over the last decades, the medical and health humanities have established themselves as vibrant interdisciplinary fields. Responding to these developments, the series seeks to encourage further innovation by stressing three points. First, in looking at health and illness as a spectrum of cultural practices, it sets out to spotlight both individual and collective experiences. With that, it draws attention to the questions of inequality and social justice and expands the purview of current research to include more-than-human subjects, entanglements, and perspectives. Second, it aims to broaden the current cultural and geographical scope beyond Western cultures and Western medicine to address different cultural and medical imaginaries as they can be found, for instance, in the Global South and Eastern Europe. Third, it emphasizes the historical and aesthetic dimensions of the expression of illness experience. With this, it draws attention to a variety of forms and media used in this context and decidedly goes beyond the narrow focus on illness narratives. This attention to the aesthetic dimension of medical and health humanities has significant consequences on the methodological level, since it opens up new spaces for conversations between media analysis, artistic practice, and empirical research. Encompassing monographs, edited collections, and critical explorations either in English or German, the peer-reviewed series offers ground-breaking interventions into the field, well-focused multidisciplinary dialogues as well as in-depth, methodologically and theoretically innovative studies.","authors":[],"language":"de","year":2025,"publisher":"De Gruyter","isbn":[],"doi":"","subjects":["Medical Humanities","Mental Health","Gender","Class","Geschlecht","Klasse","thema EDItEUR::D Biography, Literature and Literary studies::DS Literature: history and criticism::DSB Literary studies: general","thema EDItEUR::D Biography, Literature and Literary studies::DS Literature: history and criticism","thema EDItEUR::M Medicine and Nursing::MB Medicine: general issues::MBX History of medicine"],"source":"DOAB","source_url":"https://directory.doabooks.org/handle/20.500.12854/181438","cover_url":"https://directory.doabooks.org/rest/bitstreams/6e41b938-c6a6-49fc-ab34-a856375a9159/retrieve","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/20.500.12657/116670/1/9783111591933.pdf"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"open access · https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ · CC-BY","verified_legal":true,"resource_type":"book","identifiers":{"source_id":"20.500.12854/181438","handle":"20.500.12854/181438","dspace_uuid":"0501f921-a13d-487f-9d0c-8d531d2ee3e8"},"providers":[{"source":"DOAB","source_id":"20.500.12854/181438","source_url":"https://directory.doabooks.org/handle/20.500.12854/181438","language":"de","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/20.500.12657/116670/1/9783111591933.pdf"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"open access · https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ · CC-BY","verified_legal":true}]},{"id":"work:429d7c7f577e64dd2b0b2c9e","title":"Metapher und Erkenntnis","subtitle":"Beiträge zur Epistemologie der Metapher","description":"Metaphern spielen außerhalb der Sprach- und Literaturwissenschaften, der Rechtswissenschaft sowie der Theologie, wo sie seit jeher von Bedeutung sind, eine zentrale epistemologische Rolle in der Mathematik sowie in den Natur- und Sozialwissenschaften. Metaphern bilden in ihrer Erkenntnisfunktion aber auch die Grundlage für zunächst disparate Gebiete der Philosophie, von der Sprachphilosophie, der Hermeneutik, der philosophischen Anthropologie und der Wissenschaftstheorie über die philosophische Rhetorik, Ästhetik und Ideologiekritik bis hin zur Philosophie des Geistes und der Verkörperungsphilosophie. Diese Gebiete überschneiden sich wiederum mit anderen Wissenschaften, wie der Soziologie oder der Psychologie. Ausgehend von zunächst unverbunden erscheinenden Bereichen wissenschaftlicher Erkenntnis versammelt der Band interdisziplinär Beiträge zur figurativen Erkenntnis. Aufgegriffen werden dabei unter anderem Ansätze der Analytischen Philosophie, der Kritischen Theorie, der Psychoanalyse, der Kulturphilosophie und der Dekonstruktion im weitesten Sinn. Auf diese Weise arbeiten die Beiträge je verschieden hin auf eine transdisziplinäre Epistemologie der Metapher.","authors":[],"language":"de","year":2026,"publisher":"De Gruyter","isbn":[],"doi":"","subjects":["Imagery","Poetics","Hermeneutics","Bildsprache","Poetik","Hermeneutik","thema EDItEUR::Q Philosophy and Religion::QD Philosophy::QDT Topics in philosophy","thema EDItEUR::Q Philosophy and Religion::QD Philosophy::QDT Topics in philosophy::QDTK Philosophy: epistemology and theory of knowledge","thema EDItEUR::D Biography, Literature and Literary studies::DS Literature: history and criticism::DSA Literary theory","thema EDItEUR::Q Philosophy and Religion::QD Philosophy"],"source":"DOAB","source_url":"https://directory.doabooks.org/handle/20.500.12854/181444","cover_url":"https://directory.doabooks.org/rest/bitstreams/1adf62a4-9424-4671-b5d0-689e69a98f5f/retrieve","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/20.500.12657/116931/1/9783111613086.pdf"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"open access · https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ · CC-BY","verified_legal":true,"resource_type":"book","identifiers":{"source_id":"20.500.12854/181444","handle":"20.500.12854/181444","dspace_uuid":"88c32d24-e3e5-48d0-a108-c68be3716c1b"},"providers":[{"source":"DOAB","source_id":"20.500.12854/181444","source_url":"https://directory.doabooks.org/handle/20.500.12854/181444","language":"de","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/20.500.12657/116931/1/9783111613086.pdf"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"open access · https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ · CC-BY","verified_legal":true}]},{"id":"work:d42990de7b39bad713569e84","title":"Metapher und Erkenntnis","subtitle":"Beiträge zur Epistemologie der Metapher","description":"","authors":[],"language":"de","year":2026,"publisher":"De Gruyter","isbn":[],"doi":"","subjects":["Imagery","Poetics","Hermeneutics","Bildsprache","Poetik","Hermeneutik","thema EDItEUR::Q Philosophy and Religion::QD Philosophy::QDT Topics in philosophy","thema EDItEUR::Q Philosophy and Religion::QD Philosophy::QDT Topics in philosophy::QDTK Philosophy: epistemology and theory of knowledge","thema EDItEUR::D Biography, Literature and Literary studies::DS Literature: history and criticism::DSA Literary theory","thema EDItEUR::Q Philosophy and Religion::QD Philosophy"],"source":"OAPEN Library","source_url":"https://library.oapen.org/handle/20.500.12657/116931","cover_url":"https://library.oapen.org/rest/bitstreams/64fe526b-0429-4683-8036-c5cbc162a669/retrieve","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/rest/bitstreams/30051749-f7a4-480f-9b08-afe8c836bf4f/retrieve"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ · CC-BY · Other open license","verified_legal":true,"resource_type":"book","identifiers":{"source_id":"20.500.12657/116931","handle":"20.500.12657/116931","dspace_uuid":"749bd6ce-3728-4657-91a2-d0c11e98e29d"},"providers":[{"source":"OAPEN Library","source_id":"20.500.12657/116931","source_url":"https://library.oapen.org/handle/20.500.12657/116931","language":"de","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/rest/bitstreams/30051749-f7a4-480f-9b08-afe8c836bf4f/retrieve"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ · CC-BY · Other open license","verified_legal":true}]},{"id":"work:0bc70324c13c0c1c30c55df8","title":"Methods of Mathematical Finance","subtitle":"","description":"","authors":["Ioannis Karatzas","Steven E. Shreve"],"language":"en","year":1998,"publisher":"","isbn":[],"doi":"10.1007/b98840","subjects":["Stochastic processes and financial applications"],"source":"OpenAlex","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/b98840","cover_url":"","formats":[],"access":"creative_commons","license":"CC BY","verified_legal":true,"resource_type":"book","identifiers":{"source_id":"W2042775870","openalex_id":"W2042775870"},"providers":[{"source":"OpenAlex","source_id":"W2042775870","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/b98840","language":"en","formats":[],"access":"creative_commons","license":"CC BY","verified_legal":true}]},{"id":"work:b5aa508831baf8884cd7473a","title":"Methylphenidat zwischen Apparaturen und Erzählungen","subtitle":"Eine medien- und kulturwissenschaftliche Stoffgeschichte","description":"Sylvia Kokot examines the ambivalent and complex history of methylphenidate, better known as Ritalin, from the perspective of media and cultural studies. Structured as a history of the substance, this volume traces its path through a dense network of laboratories, psychiatric and educational institutions, conferences, legal proceedings, and popular science texts. From its initial synthesis in the CIBA laboratories in Basel in 1944 to the debates since the 2000s regarding the medication of hyperactive children and adults, the history of methylphenidate is unfolded as a history of the measurement and control of movement. In doing so, the book examines both the underlying assumptions and concepts embedded in the technical apparatus and studies, as well as the narratives of popular culture that influence the conceptualization of efficacy and illness. Methylphenidate is not only a medication but also a cultural and media actor with the potential to challenge social orders. Numerous efforts at regulation and control run through its history of knowledge.","authors":["Kokot, Sylvia"],"language":"de","year":2026,"publisher":"Büchner-Verlag","isbn":[],"doi":"10.14631/978-3-96317-992-1","subjects":["Popular science","ADHD","Methylphenidate","Psychopharmacology","Media history","Media archaeology","History of science","Disease","History of knowledge","Actor–Network Theory","Reportage","Cultural studies","Ritalin","Child and adolescent psychiatry","Neuroenhancement","Documentaries","thema EDItEUR::J Society and Social Sciences::JB Society and culture: general::JBC Cultural and media studies::JBCT Media studies::JBCT2 Media studies: TV and society","thema EDItEUR::J Society and Social Sciences::JB Society and culture: general::JBC Cultural and media studies::JBCT Media studies::JBCT1 Media studies: internet, digital media and society","thema EDItEUR::J Society and Social Sciences::JM Psychology::JMP Abnormal psychology","thema EDItEUR::V Health, Relationships and Personal development::VF Family and health::VFD Popular medicine and health::VFDJ Children’s health"],"source":"OAPEN Library","source_url":"https://library.oapen.org/handle/20.500.12657/117065","cover_url":"https://library.oapen.org/rest/bitstreams/1d100d87-284b-41a7-9ced-fd7addcfb6f2/retrieve","formats":[{"type":"pdf","url":"https://library.oapen.org/rest/bitstreams/78387112-3a94-4b07-984f-a3e54c9f51ee/retrieve"}],"access":"creative_commons","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/ · CC-BY-SA · Other open license","verified_legal":true,"resource_type":"book","identifiers":{"source_i